  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Samarbete &#xf6;ver gr&#xe4;nser</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Transfrontier cooperation</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektet &#xe4;mnar skapa samarbete &#xf6;ver gr&#xe4;nserna i regionen Korca-Bitola-Kozani (AL/MK/GR). Man ska skapa en ekonomisk Task Force med m&#xe5;l att utveckla ekonomiskt samarbete och kontakter &#xf6;ver de etniska gr&#xe4;nserna. Nyckelsektorer &#xe4;r aff&#xe4;rssektorn, medier, lokala myndigheter och utbildning.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims at creating and fostering co-operation over the borders in the region Korca-Bitola-Kozani (AL/MK/GR). A Task Force on economy will be created to develop an economic co-operation and contacts between different ethnic groups. Key sectors are business, media, local government and education.</narrative>
  </description>
